# gt_keymods: after each "ready N" line, a modifier and G pressed and released at one
# instant (the program reads no events meanwhile: one batch)
0 wait gt_keymods: ready 1
+100 down lctrl
+0 down g
+0 up lctrl
+0 up g
+0 wait gt_keymods: ready 2
+100 down g
+0 down lctrl
+0 up g
+0 up lctrl
+0 wait gt_keymods: ready 3
+100 down lshift
+0 down g
+0 up lshift
+0 up g
+0 wait gt_keymods: ready 4
+100 down g
+0 down lshift
+0 up g
+0 up lshift
+0 wait gt_keymods: ready 5
+100 down lctrl
+0 down g
+0 up g
+600 up lctrl
